          <div class="section-heading split-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Real homes have edge cases every day</p>
              <h2 id="exceptions-title">Today's plan changed. The rules did not.</h2>
            </div>
            <p>A fixed routine sees a trigger. The household lives through the situation around it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="exception-grid">
            {exceptions.map((item, index) => (
              <article class:list={["exception-card", item.tone]}>
                <div class="exception-media">
