              <p class="eyebrow">Notice the exception</p>
              <h2>The package arrived. Then it left.</h2>
              <p>A delivery event means one thing. The same package leaving later can mean another. HarborNavi is designed to connect the useful evidence, send the key clip, and use a pre-authorized supported speaker, siren, or doorbell response. Any call for help still waits for you.</p>
              <blockquote>Package removed. Your supported response is active. The key clip and evidence are saved.</blockquote>
            </div>
